{"verse": {"id": 2157690, "chapter_id": 4416, "verse_number": "१६", "content_sanskrit": "एष भीमो दृढक्रोधो हीनः पाण्डवसृञ्जयैः \t॥१६॥", "padaccheda": "", "anvaya": "", "meaning_sanskrit": "", "meaning_english": "", "audio_url": null, "display_order": 17}, "commentaries": [{"id": 1, "verse_id": 2157690, "commentary_type": "ಕನ್ನಡ ಅರ್ಥ", "author": "ಕನ್ನಡ ಅರ್ಥ", "lang": "kn", "content": "ದೃಢಕ್ರೋಧವುಳ್ಳ ಈ ಭೀಮನಾದರೋ ಪಾಂಡವರಿಂದಲೂ ಮತ್ತು ಸೃಂಜಯರಿಂದಲೂ ಸಹಿತನಾಗಿದ್ದಾನೆ."}]}